{"id":"5177","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5177_main_ice-pellets_hydrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">冰丸</span>是透明的冰粒，其直径不到5毫米。这些冰粒通常呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">球形</span>或不规则状，罕见锥形。它们最初是雨滴或雪花，从高层云或雨层云等层云中下落至温度高于0 °C的气层，此时雪花融化或部分融化。而后它们下落到温度低于0 °C的气层，此时它们冻结并呈冻雨落至地面。</p>\n<p>图片上部的尺子用于测量这些冰丸。下沿<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">刻度的单位是厘米（数字标记）和毫米</span>。这些冰丸直径为1-2毫米。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"©  Yuet Sim Li","location":"中国，香港，大帽山","latitude":"纬度: 22° 24' 32'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 8' 17'' E","date":"24 January 2016 0957 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.11.2.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.11.2.11"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5177_syn_ice-pellets_hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5177_upper_ice-pellets_hydrometeors.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在照片拍摄前2小时进行的高空探测显示出在830 - 450 hPa之间的厚云。在800 - 640 hPa，温度高于0°C，降水在落入这一区域时会融化。在800 hPa以下，除了在大约900 hPa的浅层和地表之外，温度低于0°C。在800 hPa之下的零下空气中，降水会冻结，并呈固态落至地面。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/radar/5177_radar_ice-pellets_hydrometeors.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"></div>","copyright":"","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5177_sat_ice-pellets_hydrometeors.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"></div>","copyright":"","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}